        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visit the Little Witch Carnival!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The club carnival parade has devolved into total chaos! As a freshman caught in the middle of it all, use your magic to survive the wild competition of talent shows as clubs go all out to outshine each other!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable little witch, exquisite dynamic pixel art;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of cute and quirky enemies with unique behaviors;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/27b5cdbc7ebb5ec8cce956b3bee2af14.poster.avif?t=1768977260\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/27b5cdbc7ebb5ec8cce956b3bee2af14.webm?t=1768977260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/3d8d7b4a3e47a6fbb52f61518b1321f5.poster.avif?t=1768977260\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/3d8d7b4a3e47a6fbb52f61518b1321f5.webm?t=1768977260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/65b88ce8969f0b2fff6279579c91f472.poster.avif?t=1768977260\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/65b88ce8969f0b2fff6279579c91f472.webm?t=1768977260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/bf49afbe37e442b78776992fa77f3591.poster.avif?t=1768977260\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/bf49afbe37e442b78776992fa77f3591.webm?t=1768977260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/e555b0b7722bb02a5460e7c85c9001c9.apng?t=1768977260\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/e555b0b7722bb02a5460e7c85c9001c9.poster.avif?t=1768977260\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich and distinct upgrades, high freedom in build customization;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique effects from different combinations to craft your own one-of-a-kind playstyle;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/53f56e07bdd69ef6bf5bc6507b21b70c.avif?t=1768977260\" width=1156 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/aab30c998be67806ed398e300f8383b7.avif?t=1768977260\" width=1156 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/extras/c54037d706dc248ec329a106892c97b6.webp?t=1768977260\" width=29 height=29 /></span><span class=\"bb_i